# Tech stack (mandatory)

Use **only** this stack. Do not substitute libraries or hand-roll equivalents.

| Layer | Use | Never |
|-------|-----|-------|
| Framework | **Next.js 16** (App Router), **React 19** | Pages Router, class components |
| Styling | **Tailwind CSS v4** (`@import "tailwindcss"`, `@theme inline`) | CSS modules, styled-components, inline styles except design-token vars |
| UI kit | **shadcn/ui** in `src/shared/components/ui/` | Custom Button, Modal, Dialog, Dropdown, Tabs, Tooltip, etc. |
| Primitives | **Radix UI** (via shadcn) | Raw `<div onClick>` overlays, home-grown focus traps / aria |
| Icons | **lucide-react** | Custom SVG icons, other icon packs |
| State | **Zustand** (`src/shared/store/`) | Redux, Context for global state, new store libs |
| Utils | `cn()` from `@/lib/utils` (`clsx` + `tailwind-merge`) | Ad-hoc class string concat |
| IDs | **nanoid** | `Math.random()`, `uuid` |

## Before writing new UI

1. Check `src/shared/components/ui/` — reuse or extend existing components.
2. Missing shadcn component? Add it: `npx shadcn@latest add <name>` (output → `src/shared/components/ui/`).
3. Need behaviour Radix already solves (dialog, popover, select, switch)? Use shadcn/Radix — **do not build your own**.

## Forbidden “bicycles”

- Custom modal / sheet / drawer → `Dialog`, `Sheet`, or `Drawer` (shadcn)
- Custom dropdown / menu → `DropdownMenu` or `Popover`
- Custom tabs → `Tabs`
- Custom form controls with a11y → shadcn `Input`, `Select`, `Checkbox`, `RadioGroup`
- Custom toast system → `Sonner` or shadcn `Toast`
- Duplicate hooks that mirror Radix/shadcn behaviour

## Allowed custom code

- Domain logic, API routes, Zustand slices, feature-specific layout (e.g. portfolio drum)
- Small gesture hooks (`useSwipe`, `useLongPress`) when no library primitive fits
- Design-token CSS vars in `globals.css` and `oklch(...)` for spec-matched screens

## Next.js

Read `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before using APIs — this repo runs Next 16 with breaking changes vs older versions.
